{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"5191","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:5191","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"ZUN","creatorId":"egs:creator:2843","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2843","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:2843","name":"ZUN","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"alias-only-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:9059","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"ZUN","creatorId":"egs:creator:2843","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2843","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:2843","name":"ZUN","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"alias-only-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:9060","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"ZUN","creatorId":"egs:creator:2843","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2843","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:2843","name":"ZUN","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"alias-only-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:9062","source":"egs"}],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10478","characterName":"蕾米莉亚·斯卡雷特","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"蕾米莉亚·斯卡雷特","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"初登场时为500岁的萝莉吸血鬼，红魔馆女主人，像贵族般注重威严和体面，性格跟外表一样非常孩子气而任性。害怕流动的水、阳光（会变蒸气，吸到蒸气的人会长生不死）、洋葱，但不怕十字架 (因为不知道有什么好怕)。曾经为了自己方便，将幻想乡笼罩在一片红雾之中（东方红魔乡）。似乎很爱喝咲夜泡的红茶（加B型血的红茶）。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10478"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10478","value":"吸血鬼"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10478","value":"操纵命运程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f690d22104f8f111475b1447410272bb87e8f7bccce675c2c305c56607c2853f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/11010676fb7eab35e4a04aa8922af5f5f7a65a2e7771da6ad731f94b3003fe69.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10483","characterName":"幽冥楼阁的亡灵少女","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"幽冥楼阁的亡灵少女","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"源远流长的西行寺家的大小姐，身为白玉楼的主人的亡灵公主。有脚的。一眼便能看出是什么都不会去想的轻浮的性格，但实际上因为已存在了一段相当长的日子，故此是有一定的知识，有时候会说出些仿佛在追寻着事物的原委般的说话，却往往是没有要点的。已成为了1000年以上的亡灵。不擅长对自己的能力没有效用的蓬莱人。是住在冥界的幽灵们的管理者。‘萃梦想’对战模式的对话中，被萃香指摘她对现世还有执念。“春雪异变”的元凶，让妖梦把“春度”收集起来，把名为“西行妖”的妖怪樱树的封印解封，使埋葬在树下的人复活。与八云紫是老朋友。生前为某“歌圣”的女儿。这个歌圣的名字没有被明确的记录下来，但在 ‘妖妖梦’中登场的和歌为“西行法师”的歌曲，再者幽幽子的姓是“西行寺”。西行寺家的古老文献中有写着“富士见之女孩”，在拥有“操纵死灵的的能力”之后便变成了“诱导别人死亡的能力”，因为厌恶简单地就能诱导人死亡的能力，与每当满开盛放时把许多人都吸引著，并成为了许多人的葬生之地，诱导别人死亡，最后化成了妖树“西行妖”的樱树。于是在“西行妖”满开之时，为了不再让“西行妖”的樱花满开，最后于树下自尽。成为亡灵后忘掉所有生前的记忆，也变得认为诱导别人死亡是一件蛮快乐的事。 (荣获第一届东方最萌冠军)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在历史上西行法师是藤原秀郷的九代孙，是藤原四大家中北家后裔，而北家开祖是藤原不比等的第二子藤原房前。若把西行寺幽幽子与藤原妹红的父亲比拟为历史人物，她们两人就有远亲关系。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10483"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10483","value":"亡灵"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10483","value":"操纵死亡程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e48a9da0c85b68dc9bff254c340a32988e7d433c926bf7aeb21dae10f5e26368.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b3203b696470b87edb27965ae16efb8069e69f6855d79327a84c3e8f6c3ef897.webp","width":126,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10822","characterName":"かざみ ゆうか","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10822","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"10822","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"}]},"originalCharacterName":"かざみ ゆうか","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"四季花之主，一年到头都生活在花之中，一旦有人类妖怪闯入，就会不问缘由以强大的力量将其消灭。与其说是花之妖怪，倒不如说在大自然的化身更贴切。和妖精不同，也和之前介绍的妖怪不可同级而语，是极其危险的妖怪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平时一直生活在花众中，看起来很和蔼，但对其他生物一点也不留情。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10822"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10822","value":"妖怪"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10822","value":"操控花程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c932e21e4a9b9533bd50c024386dcbf0cbaa8bfba98feaa37b1f1e4b3e9db5f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e386f15e0f5557a742cc71dc4d30f529eda0db295ed59a95e8365eb309625555.webp","width":225,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_11563","characterName":"疯狂的月兔","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11563","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"11563","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"11563","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"11563","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"}]},"originalCharacterName":"疯狂的月兔","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"铃仙·优昙华院·稻叶是只和其它妖兽气质大不相同的妖怪兔。她身体修长，步姿端正，不像妖兽。在妖兽之中算是活动缓慢。虽是妖兽，却从不袭击人类。相反会避开人类。有着很长耳朵和头发。总的来说，是只与众不同的妖怪兔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因幡帝是兔子们的领袖，而她则能对帝下命令（听说对方一直都不听话）。是真正的兔子们的领袖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"据说一直看着她的红眼会让人发狂，而且她的声音，要听也听不进去，相反在远处有时会听到在耳边说话。因为这么让人厌恶，几乎无法和她对话。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平时住在永远亭，在那里行动不明。有时也会来村庄售药。带着一堆怪药出现在村庄是出了名的（例如一些很苦的药）。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11563"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11563","value":"月兔"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11563","value":"操纵狂气的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bd6a6a388595ad8a650b4f5a665a9d4aa7a498bcdba8e44a6295823fb4a01d4b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c9c29222305628105dacf9cda4e10d9fdda08f715307c559c3616976345bdab.webp","width":111,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_11614","characterName":"幽人的庭师","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"11614","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"幽人的庭师","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"西行寺行家专属庭师兼幽幽子的护卫。她是代替现时行踪不明，第一代的爷爷魂魄妖忌的第二代庭师。虽也是幽幽子的剑术指导师，但幽幽子仍是把她看作庭师来看待。所谓半人半灵，除了她本身作为“半人”的人类身体的半身，还有就是一只一直紧随她的巨大幽灵，那就是她的“半灵”的半身，也是其“魂魄”家族的共同特征 (“魂魄”家族全为半人半灵,因有半灵的关系，比一般人类长寿。并世世代代侍奉著西行寺家，其后代妖梦就是其中之一)。二刀流剑士，手上有两柄刀，拥有一挥即可杀死十来只幽灵之杀伤力的长刀“楼观剑”，和可以把人的迷惘斩断的“白楼剑”。因为性格认真又率直，常被身边的人（特别是幽幽子）捉弄。感受性很强，在‘永夜抄’的结局中，变成了狂气之眼。不擅长面对怪物等恐怖的事。 ‘文花帖（书籍）’中，也会使用了替幽幽子代管的“人魂灯”(‘香霖堂’第12话“模糊的光、窗户的雪”中登场，用作收集幽灵用的道具)，把幽灵收集。根据不同的作品，其性格也有若干的不同，性格并没有被固定起来。‘儚月抄’中那完全天然的性格与‘妖妖梦’中那种逞强的性格截然不同。‘妖妖梦’时瞳孔为红色，‘萃梦想’以后变成了青色。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11614"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11614","value":"半人半灵"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11614","value":"使用剑术程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ff2fba2e98d606edd5cabe06b21c90c3b6addfda44d96433583cf53ad55fa04b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/252c2df78fb394b8950a5fd2cac232ed665afc965fabe91aa9895c542cb3660d.webp","width":231,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_12688","characterName":"十六夜 咲夜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"十六夜 咲夜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是住在红魔馆并在里面工作的女仆。是被称之为恶魔之馆的红魔馆中唯一的人类，是女仆们的仆长。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是个在普通人类不敢接近的地方工作的不可思议的少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"没人见过她在进入红魔馆之前是怎样的。而且她对幻想乡里人类的来访极为冷淡，常站在妖怪的阵营之中。所以人们觉得她不是幻想乡的人类，有可能是外面世界或者是别的世界来的人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她没有和村落里任何人类亲近，身上含有许多谜。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不过，当她去村落买东西时，她会一脸愉快，一点也没有敌视人类的样子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12688"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12688","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12688","value":"操纵时间的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/badfc65679c51a64f83971b2fbcf3fd13d46dab33013f71db781edf64f76f640.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a45982af2e686a3ac26458362bc4b1715751ec4821b9bd2da5964412df51d2bd.webp","width":186,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_16418","characterName":"三途河畔的摆渡人","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16418","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"}]},"originalCharacterName":"三途河畔的摆渡人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"担任三途河的摆渡人一职的死神。与她一起负责三途之河引渡工作的死神还有很多，不过多数时候她专门负责引渡幻想乡中人类的灵魂（×1只要她有余力，也能运送外面的世界中的人类）。因此她的身影经常在幻想乡中出现（×2在偷懒吗？）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小町脚着一双厚底木屐，手持一把极其巨大的镰刀，威严感十足。依然存活于世的生物尚且会被她的气势所压倒，失去肉体、变成存在稀薄的幽灵后更不必多说。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"此外，她喜欢找人聊天，说话语气中也透露着强烈的压迫感，由她引渡的幽灵在渡河时都会被她单方面地搭话（×3幽灵不会说话所以被其单方面搭话自然是理所当然的）。渡河期间还是闭上嘴老老实实地忍着听她说话为好。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16418"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16418","value":"死神"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16418","value":"操纵距离程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9d66d6a2f9fc0195ddce0b22e75a1d6e216e4bb303e0c02bfa122c6c4099193b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/dae7dbbddfd2142b4cad969628550485cedfb70fb3faee8d1d895fb57c140ee5.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_16419","characterName":"四季映姬・亚玛萨那度","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16419","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"}]},"originalCharacterName":"四季映姬・亚玛萨那度","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大量阎魔的其中一人。常担当幻想乡死者的裁决，是和我们关系最密切的阎魔（×1夜摩仙那度是她在是非曲直厅中的职务名，意思就是那样，意为乐园的阎魔。1）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"由于四季映姬非常喜欢说教，且她从来不会说出有失偏颇的话语，会令人油然而生一种难以接近的氛围。不过，她的说教多数还是为了幻想乡中的人类着想，面对她的说教，要坦率地表达自己的感激之情并洗耳恭听。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"这位阎魔在幻想乡很有名，特别是那些长生不老的妖怪，都曾受其关照。不过对妖怪来说，阎魔的所在，妖怪都不愿逗留。阎魔出现在幻想乡，妖怪们都会躲起来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基于这一层关系，对幻想乡中的人类而言，阎魔大人是不折不扣的伙伴。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"此外，长寿的人类中也有背负着过于沉重的罪孽的个例，若确实有可能会在死后坠入地狱，只要身处休假之中，这位阎魔大人就会直截了当地对其加以警告，敦促其洗心革面（×2当然也会将可能受到的惩罚夸张后加以威胁。）。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16419"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16419","value":"阎魔大人（花映冢） 阎魔（求闻史纪）"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16419","value":"判断是非黑白程度的能力（花映冢、求闻史纪）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/de30b07767ac3ba0a9d0e50c52237812a972d3ece79400d1b70f7cf58e15da81.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/539e7d46af7f0bd5ebb8041465f74ecdfafd560da0ec894223b0e375004f19f9.webp","width":199,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_18973","characterName":"八意 永琳","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18973","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"18973","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"18973","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"18973","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"}]},"originalCharacterName":"八意 永琳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"藥師世家，月之賢者，永琳更是族中的天才。與月之都之王的月夜見一起移居月球的前地球人。有著超乎人類想象的智慧，也是月夜見的商量对象。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『永夜抄』異變的真正黑幕。過去作為月之賢者，努力地教導輝夜。正因這個原因，在只有和輝夜兩個人的時候會用同輩的語氣與輝夜交談，但在如果有外人在會使用敬語，稱輝夜為公主殿下。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"從前利用輝夜的能力來製造了蓬萊之藥，把藥喝下的輝夜最後被逐出月球，而自己卻沒有被放逐。對於不能阻止輝夜的事而感到懊悔，於是決定一生守護著輝夜，並作為輝夜的隨從而生活。永琳本身也對在幻想鄉生活一事有興趣似的。於『儚月抄』中，她也曾經是身為其他月之使者的負責人的綿月姊妹的教導人，直到現在綿月姊妹仍很仰慕她，與為地球人稱為「嫦娥」的人物製作了蓬萊之藥。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"另外永琳的名字是假名，真正的名字地球人是無法發音的。鈴仙·優曇華院·稲葉稱她為師父。『永夜抄』異變後便一直從事藥師和醫生。『文花帖（書籍）』中向文和「魔法之森的人偶師」（目前為止登場的人物中，只有愛莉絲的條件能和該稱號相稱）販賣了「蝴蝶夢丸」（能做好夢的藥），但根據『三月精』的記述，她也有向普通的人類分配此藥。若根據『幻想鄉起緣（求聞史紀）』的話，實際上去人間之里分配藥的是永遠亭的兔們，她是專負奇難雜症的應診。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"根據霖之助聽到的傳聞，她用的是蠻高度的技術（『香霖堂』22話的描述，能想像是用X光、麻醉和移植等技術）。可是，在『文花帖（書籍）』永琳說得她好像是知道霖之助的事情，但『香霖堂』22話的描述中，霖之助好像只知道附近有一個「在竹林的一位技術出眾的醫生」存在。在『永夜抄』的冥界組（幽幽子、妖夢組）的結局與『花映塚』的梅蒂欣結局中，尋訪冥界和鈴蘭花田等，有不錯的行動力，而且有著不依賴別人凡事親力親為的性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"根據『永夜抄』附屬的角色介紹.txt（キャラ紹介.txt），看到十六夜咲夜後非常驚訝，但其理由只有永琳本人才知道。但在遊戲中面對紅魔組（蕾米莉亞、十六夜咲夜組）時卻看不出有任何特別反感的情況，而且咲夜本身也在看到永琳時說「妳是誰？」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"另外，作為與「八意」有關連的事，是長野縣戶隱村中的戶隱神社的中社內，有著名為「天八意思兼命」的神受供奉著。這個神是作為把天照大神閉居的天岩戶挪開的手段而設的神。永琳的Spell Card中也有著一道名為「八意思兼神裝置（オモイカネディバイス）」10的東西。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力實際上要比輝夜來的壓倒性的強，但總是壓抑在輝夜之下。除了製作藥的能力之外，還有用虛假的滿月來取代真正的滿月(秘術「天文密葬法」)，或是改變月球的自轉公轉的秘術，真正的實力仍是未知數。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18973"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9d46dc551cb15618462d2ef73d2d13c6369aad78e8b6d8ad7d8db522f825297.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9a5233d82c5b9d8c155df6b6ed77a23522f3e342c949347898a2368a001a0e68.webp","width":186,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_21010","characterName":"因幡帝","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21010","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"21010","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"21010","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"}]},"originalCharacterName":"因幡帝","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"迷途竹林深处的永远亭中有许多妖怪兔，这些兔子的领袖就是帝。帝能变成人形，通人话，并且因为没有烦恼，所以活了很久。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"帝在原作中被塑造成一个爱撒谎，喜欢捉弄人的人畜无害的妖怪，和妖精类似。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21010"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21010","value":"妖怪"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21010","value":"让人类幸运程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b5a13288e7b160675460b2e12b5a88d6f884c2bb24be76583cf90a8f63d8c14d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/93534cdbb0baaafdf978e2659ea4ef7342117a2e7ced24578531de3ad3b53ae9.webp","width":222,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29645","characterName":"白莉莉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29645","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"}]},"originalCharacterName":"白莉莉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力 告知春天已来临程度的能力"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"危险度 极低"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人类友好度 高"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主要活动场所 不定"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"无论人类、妖怪还是幽灵，很多都是到了春天就活动起来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"而象征性的妖精，就是带来春天的妖精，莉莉霍瓦特。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"莉莉霍瓦特能觉察到普通人未注意到的细节，将春天即将来临的消息传递给还在冬眠的生物（×1包括幽灵、亡灵等。）。这妖精通过的地方，会出现春天的暖气。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她身高颇低，有数枚很薄的翅膀（×2透明看起来有好多对薄翅，实际上只是一对大型翅膀。）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她并不好战，就算相遇也没有多大危险。只是，她在传递春天来临的消息的时候不要妨碍她比较好。这妖精也有一定的实力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和其他妖精一样，不清楚住处。除了春天之外的季节很少见到。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"所以，莉莉也被称为春之季语。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29645"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29645","value":"妖精"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29645","value":"告知春天到来程度的能力（妖妖梦、求闻史纪）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1c9f7fa912cd67799cf32947aeb55e63f81e3dd5ae22504c31d1c7df80ec15ae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/99/99a83db29da259f3cf92282c8341e3641306426c1c8a7f5a9413cead2f719043.webp","width":197,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterI