umi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"作为博丽巫女的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"在空中飞行的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"操纵灵气的程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f33007c417ade7c73b7ee78244285c2ff601da86919605a6f56c0570deb01c0c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc26d83763ce8144e0a342eaeb5a41bf3e1756ec782d0268170ef9bac39c8489.webp","width":237,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_486","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1157"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"霧雨魔理沙","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"居住于魔法森林的人类魔法使，常骑着扫把，「霧雨店」的独生女。會使用魔法森林的蘑菇調製火藥，所使用的魔法幾乎只有把東西破壞的效果，而且燃料需要長時間準備，但是其效果非常強力，在Spell Card規則成立下，純粹的破壞力在人類當中屬於最高等級。此外在幻想乡是出了名的小偷，帕邱莉的图书馆、香霖堂，如果不是古明地觉会读心术，甚至连地灵殿都会惨遭毒手。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486","value":"使用魔法程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e00e4df671f5f80d5733c44e4b69596b901aad88177fc335789c2dd5ea6b2d6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a3bd6c6ab5c1df20f216ccf8f7e1581841d4fed04fe2cad0f92ce726df7fb8d1.webp","width":237,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_487","characterName":"射命丸 文","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"射命丸 文","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"射命丸文是天狗之中速度很快的鸦天狗。手持相机，在幻想乡各处奔走，记录下各种有趣的事件。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽说是鸦天狗，外表和人类并无太大差别。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"随身带着的道具是团扇、相机和文花帖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"团扇是起风的道具，一扇能刮倒屋子，二扇能刮倒大树，三扇能将旅人的斗篷吹飞。是天狗的武器。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相机是天狗的另一件武器。能将瞬间景象拍下的必杀武器（×1拍摄速度也十分地惊人。）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"拍下的相片会登载在新闻报纸上。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"文花帖是将能成为新闻记事的题材记录起来的天狗的笔记本。里面混杂了各种相片和手写文字（×2天狗的手写体意外地可爱。）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"操纵风的能力，指的是既能瞬间吹起狂风又能瞬间让狂风停止，还能肆意刮起龙卷风，纯粹追求强力的猛烈技能。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"487"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"487","value":"鸦天狗（花映冢、风神录、绯想天）/天狗（地灵殿、求闻史纪、天空璋）"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"487","value":"操纵风程度的能力（花映冢、风神录、绯想天、地灵殿、求闻史纪、天空璋）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76964ca8ed3f6929b65c57aee506edb84d82d9d95c36aa5803ddc89f98434a70.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5c30a2767989de1befcc33502cf3697399f51b28cb405e96be8425b397255b10.webp","width":161,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_488","characterName":"知识与避世的少女","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"知识与避世的少女","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大概有100岁的魔女，平常待在红魔馆里面的图书馆的知识分子，有气喘的毛病。擅长操纵七曜（火水木金土日月），名言是“凡物都有属性。所谓的属性，跟弱点是一样的东西”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Patchouli→广藿香（一种香草，因此她有“帕琪”“香草”一类的昵称），Knowledge→知识"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"魔女、魔法使"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"使用魔法程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"使用魔法（主要是属性）程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"使用魔法（主要是精灵魔法）的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"操纵火+水+木+金+土+日+月的程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b8493e88bcc7680de30e8b9e6e66890ad487612a220d97d4b7f4da9fa8fe97d9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/de86334f8179285b5b96f03c533ec39d91050913e666646d4b78d3ba0862f3c0.webp","width":151,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_890","characterName":"湖上的冰精","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"890","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"890","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"890","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"890","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"890","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"湖上的冰精","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"在雾之湖的附近，即使是夏天也会出现极端低温。这时候常能遇到的妖精就是冰之妖精。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是湖附近妖精们中的领袖般的存在，力量也比其他妖精强。她是属于好战型的，所以必须留神。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她身高颇低，穿蓝色的衣服，背后有冰之羽翼。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她有操控冷气的能力。能瞬间冻结小东西，比普通的妖精更危险。一直在释放冷气的她周围总是很寒冷。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人们不知道她住在哪里，也无法得知她平时的生活是怎样的。不光是琪露诺，所有的妖精都能溶入大自然之中，所以人类们看不见。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"890"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"890","value":"妖精"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"890","value":"操控冷气程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/25/25af4f6889a331e39b0794d719a1f9518b4db2435d771266f0facafae6918544.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bbae3be8cbaf201d20a01a4252681feb495db0eacefea46e8410e4782bb64341.webp","width":180,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:997","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:997","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:997","name":"上海アリス幻樂団","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-brand:5191:997","source":"egs"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","vndb-work-mapping-pending"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
